    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29600" root="عطف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْعَطَفٌ</span></b>  <i>A place of inclining,</i> or <i>bending;</i> (S,
O, Msb, K;) [as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْطِفٌ</span></b> , pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَاطِفُ</span>;] and
so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِطَافَةٌ</span></b> : (TA:) you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْعَطَفُ الوَادِى</span> <i>the
place of inclining,</i> or <i>bending, of the valley:</i> (S,
O, Msb, K:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَوْدِيَةِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَاطِفُ</span></b>  [<i>the places of
inclining,</i> or <i>bending, of the valleys</i>]. (K voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُسُورٌ</span>.)

